'''Bingo''' is a gamemode playable during the monthly '''SkyBlock Bingo''' event. The gamemode is accessible through {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} for the first {{Green|7}} days of every real life month, and is available to everyone with {{SBL|10}} or above.

Players who participate are challenged to reach certain milestones (solo and community goals) on a new profile to gain {{Bingo Points}}. These points can be used in the {{BingoText|shop}} to purchase various items.

{{Tocright}}

== Overview ==

To participate, players must create a temporary Bingo profile to fill the Bingo Card. Bingo profiles occupy a dedicated slot so there is no need to delete a profile, if the profile limit is reached, to participate. 

[[Auction House]], [[Bazaar]], [[Museum]], [[SkyBlock Gems|Gem Shop]] and [[Trading]] are disabled on Bingo profiles.

Next to the {{NPCSprite|Bingo}}, you will find {{NPCSprite|Alixer}} who will grant you with potion effects, which increase with each {{Green|Ⓑ Bingo Rank}}. After completing four personal goals, you can add {{NPCSprite|Alixer}} to your [[Abiphones|AⒷiphone]] contacts to receive potions from anywhere!

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

=== Bingo Card===  
:''See [[#Tasks]] for more information about tasks.'' 

Players can complete goals, which are milestones or tasks. Completing them awards the player with {{Bingo Points}}. Additional points can be awarded for completing every goal in a row, column, or diagonal.

The card consists of 25 goals in a 5x5 grid. Twenty of them are ''Personal Goal''s, and five are ''Community Goal''s, which can be contributed to by any participant. When in the Top 100 contributors for a Community Goal, the player's contribution rank is displayed.

Completing every Personal Goal awards the player with a [[Bingo Card (Item)|Bingo Card]]. This can be claimed on any profile from {{NPCSprite|Jerry}}.

