=== Bingo Rank ===
{{Bingo Points}} allow the player to purchase a {{Green|Ⓑ Bingo Rank}}. Some items in the {{BingoText|shop}} have a {{Green|Ⓑ Bingo Rank}} requirement. Each {{Green|Ⓑ Bingo Rank}} upgrade also gives the player better perks during the event. A {{Green|Ⓑ Bingo Rank}} is permanent once purchased.       

*{{BingoText|1}} is obtained by purchasing upgrade using {{Bingo Points|50}}.
*{{BingoText|2}} is obtained by purchasing upgrade using {{Bingo Points|100}}.
*{{BingoText|3}} is obtained by purchasing upgrade using {{Bingo Points|150}}.
*{{BingoText|4}} is obtained by purchasing upgrade using {{Bingo Points|200}}.

