=== Unlockable Items ===
There are several '''Extreme''' and '''Secret Bingo''' exclusive items that can be unlocked by completing a specific number of goals:   
*{{Item|Bingo Wisdom Talisman}}
*{{Item|Bingonimbus 2000}}
*{{Item|Bingolibur}} 
*{{Item|Binghoe}}
*{{Item|Bingbow}}
*{{Item|Bingo Rod}}
*{{Item|Bingo Lava Rod}}
*{{Item|Bingo Booster}}
*{{Item|Bingo Rift Talisman}}
*{{Item|Bingo Blaster}}

These are all {{Soulbound}} and cannot be transferred to, or obtained on, other profiles.

=== Item Transfer ===
Up to 10 slots worth of Items (this includes Stackables up to their maximum Stack (1/16/64)) on a Bingo profile, excluding{{soulbound}} items, can be transferred to a regular profile or an [[Ironman]] profile.

The items can be claimed on the receiving profile from {{NPCSprite|Jerry}} on your private island.

{{NPCSprite|Bingo}} remains in the {{Zone|Village}} for three days following the conclusion of the event. This gives you time to transfer items before the Bingo profile is permanently deleted, or to make purchases in the Bingo Shop.

== Bingo Modes ==
=== Extreme Bingo ===
The '''Extreme Bingo Event''' mode is a harder version of {{Gamemode|Bingo}} that occurs with an admin's notice. When it occurs, it replaces the normal Bingo Event of that month.

'''Extreme Bingo''' lasts for {{Green|14}} Earth days instead of {{Green|7}}, features tasks of increased difficulty, and {{Gold|doubles}} the value of {{Bingo Points}} earned. A special [[Bingo Card (Item)|Bingo Card]] will be rewarded if all tasks are completed.

=== Secret Bingo ===
Similar to Extreme Bingo, '''Secret Bingo''' is a modified version of Bingo that occurs with an admin's notice. When it occurs, it replaces the normal Bingo Event of that month.
'''Secret Bingo''' lasts for {{Green|14}} Earth days instead of {{Green|7}} and {{Gold|doubles}} the value of {{Bingo Points}} earned. Additionally, all personal and community goal objectives are hidden until discovered. Personal goal titles are not revealed until the beginning of the event, with up to three hints being revealed over the first seven days for each goal if not discovered. When a personal goal is completed, the player's position in how fast they completed the goal compared to other players is revealed. A special [[Bingo Card (Item)|Bingo Card]] is rewarded if all tasks are completed. {{Item|Bingo's Secrets}} is also obtained by the first player to complete each personal goal.

