==Bugs==        
*In the 3rd event (February 2022), community goal with contributions in the position of #100 or higher gives only "All Contributors Reward" rather than the right amount regarding to the percentile. Many screenshots of wrongly-calculated rewards can be found in the forum thread.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/bugged-bingo-points.4811545/#post-34642712</ref>       
**The lacking bingo points have been complemented in the start of 4th event (March 2022).
*During the 10th event (September 2022), brewing stands were disabled making it harder to get a 17 Skill Average for the "Skill Average" task. On the last day of the Bingo event the Skill Average requirement was lowered from 17 to 14 to make up for the fact that players could not level their alchemy using brewing stands.

==Trivia==               
*Despite the Community Shop being disabled, account upgrades (e.g. {{Item|Accessory Bag}} upgrade) still take effect.
*Upgrading your Bingo Rank in the middle of a Bingo event will give you access to better potion effects from {{NPCSprite|Alixer}}, but won't give you other perks such as an upgraded rarity {{Item|Bingo Pet}}.
*The highest amount of points obtainable during a single Bingo event is {{gold|160}}. This means that dyeing a full set of armor using [[Bingo Dye]] would take 10 months, assuming the player already has the required {{BingoText|3}}.
*2024 is the first year to have no Extreme or Secret Bingo.

